*20
	*0
TEXT /F      *DATA12*
F 
F.FAST SAMPLE THE A-D
F..WRITE DATA ON TAPE 
F...MANIPULATE DATA
H        (DIFFERENTIATE, INTEGRATE,
H         FILTER, SCALE, ETC.) \/
*200
TEXT /
FTYPE:      TO DO:
FA-ADD RIGHT SWITCHES
FB-BAR GRAPH
H    (TYPE C TO RETURN TO DATA DISPLAY)
H 
FD-DIFFERENTIATE
FF-FILTER (LOW PASS)
FH-FILTER (HIGH PASS)
H 
H              (MORE)\/
	*400
TEXT /FTYPE:      TO DO:
FI-INTEGRATE
FL-MAKE LARGER
FO-ORIGINAL DATA
FP-INVERT POLARITY
FR-READ A TAPE BLOCK
F 
H              (MORE)\/
*600
TEXT /FTYPE:      TO DO:
FS-MAKE SMALLER
FW-WRITE DATA ON TAPE
FX-NEW EXTERNAL INPUT
H    (RETURN TO CHANNEL SELECT FRAME)
H 
FCR-REPEAT SAMPLING
H      (OF THE SAME CHANNEL)
F 
H              (MORE)\/
*1000
TEXT /F  SENSE SWITCHES:
H 
F0 - STOP AFTER 1ST
F    SWEEP AND DISPLAY
F1 - SLOPE CONTROL
H        (INPUT SYNCHRONIZATION)
H 
F4 - SUPPRESS CURSOR
F5 - SUPPRESS BASELINE
F 
H              (MORE)\/
*1200
TEXT /F      KNOBS:
H 
F0 - SAMPLING DC BIAS
F4 - THRESHOLD
F5 - CURSOR
F2 - X-COORDINATE
F6 - Y-COORDINATE
F 
H         CONTROL S TO START\/
*1400
TEXT /F 
F 
F    NO MORE HELP.
F 
F    HIT CONTROL S
F      TO START. \/
*1600
TEXT /F 
F 
F 
F    HIT CONTROL S.\/
